1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,900
Are you a SMART fella,

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,933
or a FART smella?

3
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:06,433
Let's find OUT!

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,433
Check this out,

5
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:11,267
a word analogy!

6
00:00:11,267 --> 00:00:13,733
Big is to huge,

7
00:00:13,733 --> 00:00:16,167
as small is to...

8
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:16,800
what?

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,400
A.

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,000
Little,

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,633
B.

12
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:19,233
Short,

13
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:19,833
C.

14
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:20,467
Tiny,

15
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:21,667
or D.

16
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:22,300
Medium?

17
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,533
Five seconds!

18
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,500
TIME'S UP!

19
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:31,633
It's...

20
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:32,100
C,

21
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:32,567
tiny!

22
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:34,467
Huge means very big,

23
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:36,800
so tiny means very small.

24
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,633
Each pair goes from the plain

25
00:00:39,633 --> 00:00:41,967
word to the stronger word.

26
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:43,800
Okay,

27
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,800
a number series!

28
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,467
One,

29
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:47,100
three,

30
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:47,767
nine,

31
00:00:47,767 --> 00:00:48,433
twenty-seven,

32
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:49,767
and then...

33
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:51,767
what comes next?

34
00:00:51,767 --> 00:00:52,433
A.

35
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:53,100
Fifty-four,

36
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:53,733
B.

37
00:00:53,733 --> 00:00:54,400
Seventy-two,

38
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,067
C.

39
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:55,733
Eighty-one,

40
00:00:55,733 --> 00:00:57,067
or D.

41
00:00:57,067 --> 00:00:57,733
Ninety?

42
00:00:57,733 --> 00:00:59,067
Five seconds!

43
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:06,033
TIME'S UP!

44
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,400
The answer is...

45
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:08,967
C,

46
00:01:08,967 --> 00:01:09,533
eighty-one!

47
00:01:09,533 --> 00:01:12,933
Each number is multiplied by three:

48
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:13,500
one,

49
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,067
three,

50
00:01:14,067 --> 00:01:14,633
nine,

51
00:01:14,633 --> 00:01:15,200
twenty-seven,

52
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,633
so twenty-seven times three is eighty-one.

53
00:01:19,767 --> 00:01:20,833
Here's one,

54
00:01:20,833 --> 00:01:22,433
a shape puzzle!

55
00:01:22,433 --> 00:01:24,567
Which shape comes next?

56
00:01:24,567 --> 00:01:25,100
A.

57
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,167
A circle,

58
00:01:26,167 --> 00:01:26,700
B.

59
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:27,767
A hexagon,

60
00:01:27,767 --> 00:01:28,300
C.

61
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,367
A square,

62
00:01:29,367 --> 00:01:30,433
or D.

63
00:01:30,433 --> 00:01:31,500
An octagon?

64
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:32,567
Five seconds!

65
00:01:38,367 --> 00:01:39,567
TIME'S UP!

66
00:01:40,233 --> 00:01:41,700
The answer is...

67
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,167
B,

68
00:01:42,167 --> 00:01:43,167
a hexagon!

69
00:01:43,167 --> 00:01:46,067
The sides count up by one:

70
00:01:46,067 --> 00:01:47,033
triangle three,

71
00:01:47,033 --> 00:01:48,000
square four,

72
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
pentagon five,

73
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,900
so next is the hexagon with

74
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:52,867
six sides.

75
00:01:54,033 --> 00:01:54,433
So,

76
00:01:54,433 --> 00:01:56,467
are you smart or fart?

77
00:01:56,467 --> 00:01:58,900
Count up your correct answers to

78
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,100
find your rank!

79
00:02:01,267 --> 00:02:01,600
So,

80
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,000
how did you do?

81
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,367
Comment your score below,

82
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:05,733
and follow for more!
